Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:29.13,Kick,,0,0,0,,BLINKIT · EXPLAINED
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:29.13,Title,,0,0,0,,10 MINUTES.\NNOT THE RIDER.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:29.13,Foot,,0,0,0,,Source: Eternal Q2 FY27 results via Business Standard\NFull video on the channel
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.15,0:00:02.40,Big,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1640)\fad(120,150)}THE DARK STORE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Blinkit delivers in ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.70,0:00:03.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}And it is not because the rider is fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:04.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Here is the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.30,0:00:08.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}A dark store is a small warehouse inside your neighbourhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.47,0:00:09.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}No customers walk in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.58,0:00:13.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}It's packed with the few thousand things people order again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.73,0:00:17.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Because the store is close, the rider only goes a short distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:20.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}The speed comes from where the store sits, not from fast driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.92,0:00:25.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Blinkit had two thousand seven hundred and fifty-one dark stores at the end of September.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.35,0:00:29.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}It wants more than three thousand five hundred by March twenty twenty-seven.
